8130","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖M学園の学園長にして、学園の母体となっているM教団の幹部。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"敬虔なクリスチャンであり、神の教えを従順に守る清らかな心の持ち主。従って２９歳になる現在も処女である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが清らかな心とは裏腹に、肉体の造りは淫靡極まる事を阿久津に見抜かれ、その穢れを知らぬ身体を狙われてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「人を疑う」という意識が希薄で、心より信頼している阿久津が学園を騒乱の渦に陥れた張本人である事には勿論気付いていない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"147349"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c1/c17a25fb5b7aa16055ea842e23c8dd754e6839106bab41bbdb0b08241904aac8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71854f4f699a7a964d8e75d349eb2e356c934266e422a8dc430b8463c249f3c1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夏川 菜々美","creatorId":"vndb:s1099","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1099","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1099","name":"若泉 絵子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3556","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33320","characterName":"立花 真緒","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"147350","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"265116"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25111"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33320"},"originalCharacterName":"立花 真緒","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"92"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞台となる学園で英語を教える女教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"海外の有名大学を優秀な成績で卒業し、日本へと帰国。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"敬虔なクリスチャンで、正義感が強く、間違ったことや曲がったことを嫌う。"},{"spoiler":f